{"t":"CLF","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Cleveland-Cliffs Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","employees":25000,"hq":"Cleveland, OH, United States","website":"https://www.clevelandcliffs.com","summary_en":"Cleveland-Cliffs Inc. operates as a steel producer in the United States and Canada. It offers hot-rolled, cold-rolled, and coated products, such as aluminized, electrogalvanized, and galvalume products, as well as galvanneal and hot-dipped galvanized products; stainless and electrical products, including GOES, NOES, and auto chrome; plate products; and slab and other steel products. The company also provides non- steelmaking products comprising stamped components, tool and die, and tubing; and scrap, iron ore, HBI, coal, and coke products. It also provides tubular components, including carbon steel, stainless steel, and electric resistance welded tubing products. In addition, the company is involved in the mining of iron ore; production of pellets and direct reduced iron; and processing of ferrous scrap through primary steelmaking and downstream finishing, stamping, tooling, and tubing. It serves direct automotive, infrastructure and manufacturing, distributors and converters, and steel producers. The company was formerly known as Cliffs Natural Resources Inc. and changed its name to Cleveland-Cliffs Inc. in August 2017. Cleveland-Cliffs Inc. was founded in 1847 and is headquartered in Cleveland, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Cleveland-Cliffs Inc.는 미국과 캐나다에서 철강 생산업체로 운영되고 있습니다. 알루미늄 도금, 전기 아연 도금, 갈바륨 제품뿐만 아니라 갈바닐 및 용융 아연 도금 제품과 같은 열간 압연, 냉간 압연 및 코팅 제품을 제공합니다. GOES, NOES 및 자동 크롬을 포함한 스테인레스 및 전기 제품; 접시제품; 슬래브 및 기타 철강 제품. 이 회사는 또한 스탬핑 부품, 공구 및 다이, 튜빙으로 구성된 비제강 제품도 제공합니다. 스크랩, 철광석, HBI, 석탄 ​​및 코크스 제품. 또한 탄소강, 스테인리스강, 전기 저항 용접 튜브 제품을 포함한 관형 부품도 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 철광석 채굴에도 참여하고 있습니다. 펠릿 및 직접환원철 생산; 1차 제강 및 다운스트림 마무리, 스탬핑, 툴링 및 튜빙을 통한 철 스크랩 처리. 직접적인 자동차, 인프라 및 제조, 유통업체 및 변환기, 철강 생산업체에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Cliffs Natural Resources Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2017년 8월에 Cleveland-Cliffs Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Cleveland-Cliffs Inc.는 1847년에 설립되었으며 오하이오주 클리블랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":11.16,"mcap":6367728128.0,"pe":null,"fpe":6.5608463,"peg":null,"ps":0.3172285,"pb":1.119695,"ev_ebitda":13.982,"div":0.0,"beta":1.976,"hi52":15.35,"lo52":7.73},"fin":{"rev":20073000960.0,"rev_g":0.185,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.01539,"op":-0.00169,"net":-0.023559999,"roe":-0.07265,"fcf":220250000.0,"cash":77000000.0,"debt":7664000000.0,"de":128.461,"eps":-0.87,"feps":1.701},"own":{"short":0.1093,"inst":0.82102996,"insider":0.0086},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":14.75,"median":14.0,"high":18.0,"low":13.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.69231,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":2,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":11,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":15.0,"priorPriceTarget":12.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":14.0,"priorPriceTarget":12.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"B. Riley Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":18.0,"priorPriceTarget":15.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Underweight","FromGrade":"Underweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":12.0,"priorPriceTarget":11.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":13.0,"priorPriceTarget":12.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"Morgan Stanley",